:opacity-95 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-500-accent" type="button" data-lightbox-src="https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg"><img width="970" height="546" data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 660px, 970px" srcset="https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/400/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 320w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/400/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 400w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/500/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 500w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/600/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 600w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 640w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 660w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 768w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 800w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 970w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 1000w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 1200w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 1280w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 1320w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 1536w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg 1940w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="詹智翔初選過關，將代表民進黨參選台中市第十四選區市議員。 圖：唐復年／攝" class="h-full w-full object-contain object-center" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" itemprop="image" src="https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366075de51.jpg"></button><figcaption class="body-sm-16 text-text-gray mt-3 mx-auto news-article-content">詹智翔初選過關，將代表民進黨參選台中市第十四選區市議員。 圖：唐復年／攝</figcaption></figure><div class="news-article-body news-article-content flow-root mx-auto" data-v-9c0dd4a7 data-v-a671669a><div class="gam-slot gam-slot--all mx-auto gam-slot--fluid" style="" data-v-a671669a data-v-83bbd4e9><!----><div id="div-gpt-ad-1671763666834-0" class="gam-slot__content gam-slot__content--fluid" style="" data-v-83bbd4e9></div></div><!----><div class="gliaplayer-slot hidden float-right ml-[10px] mb-[1em] h-[257px] w-[400px] lg:block" data-v-a671669a><div class="gliaplayer-container" data-slot="adgeek_newtalk_curation_desktop_middle" data-article="newtalk.tw"></div></div><div id="newtalk-news-view-content" class="body-lg-20 text-text-iron articleBody" data-article-font-size="medium" itemprop="articleBody" data-v-a671669a><p class="mb-5 last:mb-0 wrap-break-word">民主進步黨 2026 年直轄市議員提名初選民調作業，今（25）日公布<a class="text-primary-500-accent hover:text-primary-400 underline transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-gtm-click="keyword_anchor_click" href="/search?q=%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%82">台中市</a>第十四選區（東勢等四區）民調結果，由新人詹智翔勝出。</p>
<p class="mb-5 last:mb-0 wrap-break-word">詹智翔是立委<a class="text-primary-500-accent hover:text-primary-400 underline transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-gtm-click="keyword_anchor_click" href="/search?q=%E8%94%A1%E5%85%B6%E6%98%8C">蔡其昌</a>在山城地區第一位專職的服務處主任，學經歷相當豐富，台中二中、中正大學、台大研究所，博士班期間曾赴日本大阪大學交換，畢業後首份工作是中研院研究助理，而後轉職<a class="text-primary-500-accent hover:text-primary-400 underline transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-gtm-click="keyword_anchor_click" href="/search?q=%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2">立法院</a>擔任法案助理，2022 年 8 月返鄉為蔡其昌輔選，在家鄉經歷了三個多月緊湊且充實助選工作，也讓他有機會重新認識自己的故鄉。市長選舉過後，蔡其昌認為，在山城需要一位對政治工作有熱忱的專職人員，2023 年 5 月詹智翔正式返鄉。</p>
<p class="mb-5 last:mb-0 wrap-break-word">詹智翔說，返鄉服務後發現家鄉需要更多好的政策，例如山城每 4 人就有一位是 65 歲以上長輩，生活值得更好照顧。如醫療資源亟待創造，山城只有一間農民醫院，衛生所專業人力不足，出外就醫還有交通問題，公車班次減少、小黃公車不足等，未來應該儘速補足衛所醫師，推動遠端醫療，也要讓山城有更多短中程計程車可使用敬老卡，讓長輩生活更健康方便。</p><div class="news-article-body__ad-slot" data-article-ad-group="inline-1"></div><div class="news-article-body__recommend-slot" data-article-recommend-group="inline-1"></div>
<p class="mb-5 last:mb-0 wrap-break-word">此選區現任民進黨籍市議員蔡成圭已宣布不再連任，新系趁勢推出詹智翔參選，參加初選的還有石岡區九房里長張鴻斌，詹智翔雖有新人加權，但依舊以 0.3933 的成績勝過張鴻斌的 0.1269，將可獲得提名。</p>
<div> </div></div></div><!----><!----><!----><!--[--><figure class="w-full" data-v-9c0dd4a7><button class="relative aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden bg-background-main article-lightbox-trigger transition-opacity hover:opacity-95 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-500-accent" type="button" data-lightbox-src="https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png"><img width="970" height="546" data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) 660px, 970px" srcset="https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/400/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 320w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/400/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 400w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/500/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 500w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/600/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 600w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 640w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 660w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 768w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/800/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 800w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 970w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 1000w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 1200w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 1280w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 1320w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 1536w, https://images.newtalk.tw/resize_action2/1200/album/news/1027/69c366083ca50.png 1940w" onerror="this.setAt